{"version":1,"content":"<p>讓《GTA 6》在PC上運行的競賽已經全面展開。Rockstar至今仍未公佈官方PC版的時間表，但傳聞稱正式版本可能在2027年第一季度推出。不過，玩家社區顯然不打算繼續等待。目前有多個《GTA 6》重編譯和移植項目正在進行，其中一些項目的進度相對領先。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1588136.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.869055+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:02:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_hash":"d62ac0a7e5c70c68441ddeb6f643d410fb4e29295d4475e62ad8738c37a4d2b0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}